        <p class='quote-text font-islamic'>"What counts in making a happy marriage is not so much how compatible you are, but how you deal with incompatibility. A great marriage is not when the perfect couple comes together. It is when an imperfect couple learns to enjoy their differences."</p>
        <p class='guest-label font-body'>Kepada Yth. Bapak / Ibu / Saudara/i</p>
