        <div class='hero-text-content'>
          <h2 class='font-heading-script animated-slow elementor-invisible'>The Wedding of</h2>
          <h1 class='font-heading-script animated-slow elementor-invisible'>Fredy Bastian Nugroho &amp; Siti Mukholifah</h1>
          <h2 class='heading-fadeInUp date-text'>Rabu, 28 September 2026</h2>
